.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
| Introduction                                                                |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

- -- ------------------------------------------------------------------- --- --
               !!! - THIS IS AN UPDATED & BUGFIXED VERSION - !!!
- -- ------------------------------------------------------------------- --- --


  SAD-Request  is  an so called REQUEST DOOR.  If anybody like to have an old
  file or an special file that never appeared to your BBS or what the hell he
  like, he can use this door.

  Other  Request  doors  I  know  just do a TEXTFILE appending which you must
  include  as  a  textfile  or  call  It  using MCI commands or put it to the
  bulletins!  CRAP!  Why not send it to the Message base!?  This is waht this
  door is doing!  With pure AREXX power ofcoz!

  See FEATURES for the two or three features it has included!

- -- ------------------------------------------------------------------- --- --
               !!! - THIS IS AN UPDATED & BUGFIXED VERSION - !!!
- -- ------------------------------------------------------------------- --- --



.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
| Requirements                                                                |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

  I  don`t  know If Mr.  J.  Hodge has changed the /X REXX PORT since /X $Ver
  2.0!  But If he did so then you need at least /X 2.0+ to run this door!

  Amiga  OS 2.04+ would also be very usefull because of the RexxMAST you need
  to run this door!


.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
| Features                                                                    |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

  Just  a  simple  (less  or  more) REQUEST door with REQUEST -> MSGBASE send
  option instead of Textfile output!


.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.
| Installation                                                                |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'

  Copy the Dir "BBS/DOORS/SCEPTIC/F!-Request" to your "DOORS:"

  Copy  the given BBSCMD to your "BBSCMD" location or wherever you store your
  BBS COMMANDS!

  Now  load  the  config  file  and  edit  it to your needs:  Here`s a closer
  information:

ConfPath	= "<path to the conference in which MSGBASE are you like to
                    send the REQUEST MAILS!>

E.G. 		Confpath = "bbs:request"


