| ABOUT SAD                                                                   |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'


    We in SAD are searching some good /X-Door and Tool coder (AIM, XIM etc.)

        If you`re searching a NICE and "WANT-TO-BE-ACTIVE" group then we
                       might be the right choice for YOU!

      You`ve NOT to leave your actual Group, you can join us just for /X!

       So if you`re a C, E, ASM, AREXX coder or an ANSI artist or a SYSOP
     who like to open a DST SITE (BETA SITE) then just get in contact with

