                         Some closer Information on SAD
                        +------------------------------+



    SCEPTIC itself was founded in the early month of 1992! We released some
             demos, intros, trainers, patches and ansi collections.

      Our most famous production was CHIPMANIA (soon be released under the
                 HAUJOBB label because I (fli7e) joined them!)

      Then .. In summer 1994 I kicked all inactive members and decided to
     change the way we go! DEMO-GROUP .. R.I.P .. /X + Toolgroup .. ALIVE!

   From there on we worked a long time in the underground .. NO RELEASES ..!

   But that should change NOW! With your help a famous group could be REBORN!

                                Actual "MEMBERS"

            FLi7e/HAUJOBB ^ N-JOY ^ SAD    (Leader, /X CODER, SYSOP)
            H2o/SAD                                   (AZZKY Layout)
            PIWI/SAD                                      (/X CODER)
            SLY/SAD                              (TRADER & /X CODER)
            CASIO/SAD                                        (CODER)
            WIGWAM/SAD                                       (CODER)
            SHADOWMASTER/IFT^SAD                          (/X CODER)
            COUGAR/HOODLUM                             (BETA TESTER)

  Well, not that much I think! And because of that we`ll try to strike again!

